      <h2 class="faq-title">FREQUENTLY ASKED<br/><span class="outline-text">QUESTIONS.</span></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <div class="faq-item" onclick="this.classList.toggle('active')">
        <div class="faq-question">What is your shipping policy? <span class="toggle">+</span></div>
        <div class="faq-answer">We offer FREE worldwide shipping on all orders. Delivery typically takes 5-10 business days depending on your location. All orders are fully tracked and insured.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item" onclick="this.classList.toggle('active')">
        <div class="faq-question">What is your return policy? <span class="toggle">+</span></div>
        <div class="faq-answer">We stand behind the quality of our objects. We offer a strict 4-day return policy from the date of delivery. If you receive a defective or damaged item, please contact us within 4 days to arrange a replacement or refund.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item" onclick="this.classList.toggle('active')">
        <div class="faq-question">Are these products authentic? <span class="toggle">+</span></div>
        <div class="faq-answer">Absolutely. We are an authorized retailer for all brands we carry. Every product is rigorously verified by our curation team before it makes it to our storefront.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item" onclick="this.classList.toggle('active')">
        <div class="faq-question">How can I track my order? <span class="toggle">+</span></div>
        <div class="faq-answer">Once your order ships, you will receive an email with a tracking number. You can also track your order directly on our website using our Order Lookup page.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

